WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
And again, per the chief of patrol,

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:07.120
we have all the units that, per 999,

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.640
chief of patrol said all units clear out from there.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.160
We're not sending anybody over to that location.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.600
Chicago PD says they did show up,

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.799
but the dispatch you just heard

00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:20.080
said they were told to stand down.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.240
The mayor of Chicago doesn't think all lives matter.

